  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Clingendael academy capacity-building programme for IDRI and young diplomats</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The overall objective of the proposed cooperation between the Netherlands and Algeria is:&#x2022;	To develop the capacity and ensure sustainability of the Algerian Institut Diplomatique et des relations Internationales (IDRI).&#x2022;	To strengthen the capacity of young diplomats, on a range of topics relevant for their profession in diplomatic relations, to strengthen the diplomatic and bilateral relations between the Netherlands and Algeria.</narrative>
  </description>
